      "text": "Section 1. I hereby proclaim the establishment of a Block Security Guidelines Board to consist of six members: the Director of the Bureau of the Budget, as Chairman, the Chairman of the City Planning Commission, the Director of the Office of Neighborhood Government, the Director of the Criminal Justice Coordinating Council, the Commissioner of the Police Department, and the Economic Development Administrator.",
